# 🌸 Iris Flower Prediction App

An interactive Machine Learning web application that predicts the species of an Iris flower based on its sepal and petal measurements.

Built using Python, Streamlit, Scikit-learn, NumPy, and Pandas, the application provides real-time predictions through an intuitive user interface with engaging animations and visual feedback.

## Features

* 🌸 Predicts Iris flower species (Setosa, Versicolor, Virginica)
* 🎨 Attractive and animated user interface
* 📊 Machine Learning-based classification model
* ⚡ Real-time predictions using user inputs
* 🎈 Interactive visual feedback with Streamlit

## Technologies Used

* Python
* Streamlit
* Scikit-learn
* NumPy
* Pandas
* Joblib

## Machine Learning Workflow

1. Data Collection & Preprocessing
2. Model Training using Scikit-learn
3. Model Serialization with Joblib
4. Interactive Deployment using Streamlit

## Project Objective

To demonstrate the practical implementation of Machine Learning classification techniques by building a user-friendly web application capable of accurately identifying Iris flower species from input measurements.
